UAAUUGAAUUUUGAACACUCU&UGACCCACCUCCUGGAAUGACCUUAAAUGAGAAGAGUGUUCAAAAUUCAAUUACACAGUGGAUUGUAGACAUGGAAGGUGCACCAGGUACCUUAUAUGAAGGGGAAAAAUUUCAACUUCUAUUUAAAUUUAGUAGUCGAUAUCCUUUUGACUCUCCUCAGGUCAUGUUUACUGGUGAAAAUAUUCCUGUUCAUCCUCAUGUUUAUAGCAAUGGUCAUAUCUGUUUAUCCAUUC\
